<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>IELTS Listening Practice Test (Test 3)</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Merriweather:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,700;1,300;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Font Awesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
                        serif: ['Merriweather', 'serif'],
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    
    <style>
        /* Tùy chỉnh thanh cuộn cho mượt mà */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #f4f4f5; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #d4d4d8; border-radius: 3px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #a1a1aa; }

        /* Tùy chỉnh vùng bôi màu câu hỏi */
        mark.ielts-highlight { border-radius: 2px; cursor: pointer; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
        mark.ielts-highlight:hover { opacity: 0.8; }
        
        .question-target { transition: background-color 0.5s ease; scroll-margin-top: 30px; }
        .question-target.highlight-scroll { background-color: #f4f4f5; }

        /* Ô nhập liệu dạng gạch chân đặc trưng của IELTS */
        .blank-underlined {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            background: transparent;
            outline: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .blank-underlined:focus {
            border-bottom-color: #2563eb;
            background-color: #eff6ff;
        }

        /* Định dạng các nút chọn trắc nghiệm và selector */
        .mc-opt-btn.active { border-color: #000000 !important; background-color: #f4f4f5 !important; }
        .mc-opt-btn.active .radio-circle { border-color: #000000 !important; }
        .mc-opt-btn.active .radio-dot { transform: scale(1) !important; opacity: 1 !important; }

        .custom-select {
            appearance: none;
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;charset=UTF-8,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'%3E%3Cpolyline points='6 9 12 15 18 9'%3E%3C/polyline%3E%3C/svg%3E");
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: right 8px center;
            background-size: 14px;
            padding-right: 28px;
        }

        /* Định dạng hiển thị màu sắc khi đã chấm điểm */
        .graded-correct { background-color: #f0fdf4 !important; border-color: #22c55e !important; color: #15803d !important; }
        .graded-correct .radio-circle { border-color: #22c55e !important; }
        .graded-correct .radio-dot { background-color: #22c55e !important; transform: scale(1) !important; opacity: 1 !important; }

        .graded-wrong { background-color: #fef2f2 !important; border-color: #ef4444 !important; color: #b91c1c !important; }
        .graded-wrong .radio-circle { border-color: #ef4444 !important; }
        .graded-wrong .radio-dot { background-color: #ef4444 !important; transform: scale(1) !important; opacity: 1 !important; }
        .text-line-through { text-decoration: line-through; }

        .input-correct { border-color: #22c55e !important; background-color: #f0fdf4 !important; color: #15803d !important; font-weight: bold; }
        .input-wrong { border-color: #ef4444 !important; background-color: #fef2f2 !important; color: #ef4444 !important; text-decoration: line-through; }
        
        .nav-correct { background-color: #22c55e !important; color: white !important; border-color: #16a34a !important; }
        .nav-wrong { background-color: #ef4444 !important; color: white !important; border-color: #dc2626 !important; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-zinc-900 overflow-hidden h-screen flex flex-col font-sans select-none">

    <!-- Đối tượng Audio trung tâm để phát âm thanh cục bộ -->
    <audio id="exam-audio" preload="auto"></audio>

    <!-- HỘP THOẠI BẮT ĐẦU THI (Chọn file âm thanh duy nhất) -->
    <div id="start-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-zinc-950 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center z-[200] transition-opacity duration-300">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 w-11/12 max-w-lg shadow-2xl text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 shadow-lg">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-headphones-simple text-2xl animate-pulse"></i>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-black">IELTS Listening Practice Test 3</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-6 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                Please drag and drop your single, continuous MP3 listening file for Test 3 into the zone below, or click to browse. Once loaded, the test will begin in continuous CD mode without Play/Pause keys.
            </p>
            
            <!-- VÙNG KÉO THẢ FILE -->
            <div id="audio-drop-zone" class="border-2 border-dashed border-zinc-300 hover:border-black rounded-lg p-8 mb-6 cursor-pointer transition-all bg-zinc-50 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-audio text-4xl text-zinc-400" id="audio-drop-icon"></i>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-zinc-700" id="audio-drop-text">Drag & drop your full test audio here, or click to browse</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-zinc-400">Accepts a single continuous .mp3 or .wav file</p>
                <input type="file" id="local-audio-input" accept="audio/*" class="hidden">
            </div>

            <button class="bg-zinc-300 text-zinc-500 font-bold py-4 px-10 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest rounded-lg transition-all w-full cursor-not-allowed" id="btn-start-test" disabled>
                Select Audio File First
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HEADER CHỨA THỜI GIAN VÀ KHÔNG CÓ NÚT PLAY -->
    <header class="bg-black text-white px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center border-b-2 border-black z-30 select-none shrink-0">
        <div class="logo-area flex items-center gap-4">
            <h1 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">IELTS Listening</h1>
            <span class="bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Continuous CD Mode</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Chỉ hiển thị Trạng thái và Thanh Volume đúng quy chuẩn phòng thi máy tính -->
        <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-4 bg-zinc-950 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 text-xs select-none">
            <span id="audio-status-label" class="text-zinc-400 font-semibold tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle text-[8px] text-zinc-600"></i> No audio loaded
            </span>
            <div class="h-4 w-[1px] bg-zinc-800"></div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-volume-high text-zinc-400 text-[10px]"></i>
                <input type="range" id="volume-control" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="1" class="w-20 accent-white h-1 bg-zinc-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer" title="Adjust Volume">
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-zinc-900 px-4 py-2 rounded border border-zinc-800 font-mono text-base font-bold transition-all" id="countdown-timer">
                <i class="fa-regular fa-clock text-sm"></i>
                <span id="timer-display">40:00</span>
            </div>
            <button class="bg-white hover:bg-zinc-200 text-black font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors" id="btn-submit-exam">
                Submit Test
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- CÁC TAB CHUYỂN PHẦN CÂU HỎI -->
    <div class="flex bg-zinc-100 border-b border-zinc-200 px-6 gap-1 select-none z-20 shrink-0">
        <button class="tab-btn active px-6 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-zinc-500 border-b-2 border-transparent uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-black hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-all" data-target="1">Part 1</button>
        <button class="tab-btn px-6 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-zinc-500 border-b-2 border-transparent uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-black hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-all" data-target="2">Part 2</button>
        <button class="tab-btn px-6 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-zinc-500 border-b-2 border-transparent uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-black hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-all" data-target="3">Part 3</button>
        <button class="tab-btn px-6 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-zinc-500 border-b-2 border-transparent uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-black hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-all" data-target="4">Part 4</button>
    </div>

    <!-- KHÔNG GIAN LÀM BÀI -->
    <div class="flex flex-1 overflow-hidden relative" id="workspace-container">
        
        <!-- BẢNG BÊN TRÁI: HIỂN THỊ CÁC CÂU HỎI -->
        <div class="w-[80%] h-full overflow-y-auto p-10 bg-white border-r border-zinc-200 relative select-text" id="questions-workspace">
            
            <!-- Hướng dẫn tô màu -->
            <div class="bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-200 p-3 rounded text-xs text-zinc-700 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 select-none">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-black flex-shrink-0"></i>
                <span><strong>Highlight Tool:</strong> Select any text in the questions area with your mouse to highlight it. Click on the highlighted text to remove it.</span>
            </div>

            <!-- PART 1 QUESTIONS -->
            <div id="part-content-1" class="part-content block">
                <div class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-zinc-500 mb-2 tracking-wider">Listening Part 1</div>
                <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold mb-5 pb-3 border-b-2 border-black">Questions 1–10</h1>
                
                <div class="bg-zinc-50 border-l-4 border-black p-4 mb-8 select-none">
                    <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Complete the table below.</p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-1">Write <span class="font-bold text-black">ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</span> for each answer.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg p-6 bg-zinc-50/50 mb-8 font-serif leading-relaxed text-black max-w-4xl mx-auto">
                    <div class="text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-center text-zinc-800 border-b border-zinc-200 pb-3">Furniture Rental Companies</div>

                    <table class="w-full border-collapse">
                        <thead>
                            <tr class="border-b border-zinc-300 text-left text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 font-sans">
                                <th class="pb-3 w-1/4">Name of company</th>
                                <th class="pb-3 w-1/3">Information about costs</th>
                                <th class="pb-3 w-1/3">Additional notes</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody class="divide-y divide-zinc-200 text-[15px]">
                            <!-- Row 1 -->
                            <tr>
                                <td class="py-5 font-bold align-top">Peak Rentals</td>
                                <td class="py-5 align-top">
                                    <div class="question-target p-1 rounded" id="q-target-1">
                                        Prices range from $105 to $<input type="text" id="blank-q1" class="blank-underlined font-mono font-bold text-center px-1 w-28 text-blue-600" data-qnum="1"> per room per month.
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td class="py-5 align-top text-zinc-700">
                                    <div class="question-target p-1 rounded mb-2" id="q-target-2">
                                        The furniture is very <strong>2</strong> <input type="text" id="blank-q2" class="blank-underlined font-mono font-bold text-center px-1 w-28 text-blue-600" data-qnum="2">
                                    </div>
                                    Delivers in 1-2 days<br>
                                    Special offer:<br>
                                    <div class="question-target p-1 rounded mt-1" id="q-target-3">
                                        free <strong>3</strong> <input type="text" id="blank-q3" class="blank-underlined font-mono font-bold text-center px-1 w-28 text-blue-600" data-qnum="3"> with every living room set
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <!-- Row 2 -->
                            <tr>
                                <td class="py-5 font-bold align-top">
                                    <div class="question-target p-1 rounded" id="q-target-4">
                                        <strong>4</strong> <input type="text" id="blank-q4" class="blank-underlined font-mono font-bold text-center px-1 w-32 text-blue-600" data-qnum="4"> and Oliver
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td class="py-5 align-top text-zinc-700">Mid-range prices</td>
                                <td class="py-5 align-top text-zinc-700">
                                    <div class="question-target p-1 rounded mb-2" id="q-target-5">
                                        12% monthly fee for <strong>5</strong> <input type="text" id="blank-q5" class="blank-underlined font-mono font-bold text-center px-1 w-28 text-blue-600" data-qnum="5">
                                    </div>
                                    Also offers a cleaning service
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <!-- Row 3 -->
                            <tr>
                                <td class="py-5 font-bold align-top">Larch Furniture</td>
                                <td class="py-5 align-top">
                                    <div class="question-target p-1 rounded" id="q-target-6">
                                        Offers cheapest prices for renting furniture and <strong>6</strong> <input type="text" id="blank-q6" class="blank-underlined font-mono font-bold text-center px-1 w-32 text-blue-600" data-qnum="6"> items
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td class="py-5 align-top text-zinc-700">
                                    <div class="question-target p-1 rounded mb-2" id="q-target-7">
                                        Must have own <strong>7</strong> <input type="text" id="blank-q7" class="blank-underlined font-mono font-bold text-center px-1 w-28 text-blue-600" data-qnum="7">
                                    </div>
                                    Minimum contract length: six months
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <!-- Row 4 -->
                            <tr>
                                <td class="py-5 font-bold align-top">
                                    <div class="question-target p-1 rounded" id="q-target-8">
                                        <strong>8</strong> <input type="text" id="blank-q8" class="blank-underlined font-mono font-bold text-center px-1 w-32 text-blue-600" data-qnum="8"> Rentals
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td class="py-5 align-top">
                                    <div class="question-target p-1 rounded" id="q-target-9">
                                        See the <strong>9</strong> <input type="text" id="blank-q9" class="blank-underlined font-mono font-bold text-center px-1 w-28 text-blue-600" data-qnum="9"> for the most up-to-date prices
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td class="py-5 align-top">
                                    <div class="question-target p-1 rounded" id="q-target-10">
                                        <strong>10</strong> <input type="text" id="blank-q10" class="blank-underlined font-mono font-bold text-center px-1 w-32 text-blue-600" data-qnum="10"> are allowed within 7 days of delivery
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- PART 2 QUESTIONS -->
            <div id="part-content-2" class="part-content hidden">
                <div class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-zinc-500 mb-2 tracking-wider">Listening Part 2</div>
                <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold mb-5 pb-3 border-b-2 border-black">Questions 11–20</h1>
                
                <div class="bg-zinc-50 border-l-4 border-black p-4 mb-6 select-none">
                    <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Questions 11–16</p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-1">Choose the correct letter, <span class="font-bold text-black">A, B or C</span>.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-6 mb-10 max-w-3xl">
                    <!-- Q11 -->
                    <div class="question-target border border-zinc-200 rounded p-5 hover:border-zinc-400 transition-colors" id="q-target-11" data-qnum="11">
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold mb-3">11. Who was responsible for starting the community project?</div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mc-options-grid" data-question="q11">
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="A">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>A. the castle owners</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="B">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>B. a national charity</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="C">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>C. the local council</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Q12 -->
                    <div class="question-target border border-zinc-200 rounded p-5 hover:border-zinc-400 transition-colors" id="q-target-12" data-qnum="12">
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold mb-3">12. How was the gold coin found?</div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mc-options-grid" data-question="q12">
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="A">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>A. Heavy rain had removed some of the soil.</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="B">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>B. The ground was dug up by wild rabbits.</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="C">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>C. A person with a metal detector searched the area.</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Q13 -->
                    <div class="question-target border border-zinc-200 rounded p-5 hover:border-zinc-400 transition-colors" id="q-target-13" data-qnum="13">
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold mb-3">13. What led the archaeologists to believe there was an ancient village on this site?</div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mc-options-grid" data-question="q13">
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="A">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>A. the lucky discovery of old records</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="B">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>B. the bases of several structures visible in the grass</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="C">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>C. the unusual stones found near the castle</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Q14 -->
                    <div class="question-target border border-zinc-200 rounded p-5 hover:border-zinc-400 transition-colors" id="q-target-14" data-qnum="14">
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold mb-3">14. What are the team still hoping to find?</div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mc-options-grid" data-question="q14">
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="A">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>A. everyday pottery</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="B">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>B. animal bones</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" class="mc-opt-btn border border-zinc-300 rounded px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2.5" data-val="C">
                                <span class="radio-circle w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="radio-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-black scale-0 transition-transform duration-150"></span></span>
                                <span>C. pieces of jewellery</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
